Ananta third-party research references
======================================

Superintelligent Retrieval Agent (SIRA)
----------------------------------------

Repository: https://github.com/facebookresearch/sira
Reviewed revision: b33f5b71a1870f09b378d8e79afb6ad9e704709b
Copyright: Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates
Repository license: MIT

The Ananta implementation under worker/retrieval/sira is an independent,
from-scratch adaptation of the published retrieval ideas. No source file from
facebookresearch/sira or its bm25x subtree is included in Ananta.

The upstream directory src/sira/bm25x declares derivation from LightOn's
bm25x under Apache-2.0 and carries a NOTICE file. Ananta uses Python's SQLite
FTS5 integration instead and does not incorporate that code. If bm25x or an
upstream SIRA file is incorporated in the future, the MIT and Apache-2.0
license texts, copyright notices, NOTICE material and change markings must be
added before distribution.
